# Verification — conformance/00-evidence-kernel.md (turn 2)

## Overall assessment

The file is a complete, well-structured conformance suite for the accepted
`contracts/00-evidence-kernel.yaml` contract. It covers structure,
missingness, journal/durability, provenance, timing, capability/assessment,
diagnostic/claims, replay, lease, artifacts, manual M1 acceptance, a full
rule-to-case coverage index, and a test-run verdict gate. Epistemic
discipline is strong throughout: substantive claims carry tags, invented
corpus values (timing vectors, lease coordinates, CLI shape, exit codes,
verdict names) are marked `[proposed]`, and spot-checked extractions
(wire version, revision bound, canonicalization profile, null reasons,
manual rationale, eight-state workflow, orthogonality enums, EK rule IDs)
trace to the cited contract or sources. The tree file is byte-identical to
the raw deliverable's inner content. The file is acceptable as-is.

